"cli","deps":[{"link_uuid":"de37658d-63e9-488b-a5c8-55328d53e4ab","relation":"discovered_from","target_id":"2781-42c5-201c-4efe"}],"description":"## Context / Problem\n`reconciler/alert_store.patch_bug_filed` (`src/rebar/reconciler/alert_store.py:100-147`) reads a day's `*.jsonl` alert file, patches one record and republishes the whole file through `_atomic_write`, without holding the append lock. `append` writes the same file under `sibling_exclusive_lock(today, lock_name=_APPEND_LOCK_NAME)` (`:49`). An alert appended between the patch's `read_text` (`:123`) and its replace (`:144`) is dropped by the replace, on every platform. Found while enumerating readers for ruby-unwomanish-willet; this is a lost-update race, not that bug's Windows read refusal.\n\n## Approach\nHold the same `sibling_exclusive_lock(jf, lock_name=_APPEND_LOCK_NAME)` across the read-modify-write of each file in `patch_bug_filed`, so a patch and an append are serialized.\n\n## Scope\n- `src/rebar/reconciler/alert_store.py`\n- `tests/unit/reconciler/test_alert_store_patch_lock.py` (new)\n\n## Testing\nA unit test starts `patch_bug_filed` with its read paused (monkeypatched `_atomic_write` that waits on an event), appends an alert from another thread, then releases the patch; the appended record must survive. It fails on the current code and passes with the lock held.\n\n## Acceptance Criteria\n- [ ] The new test fails on origin/main before the change and passes after it.\n- [ ] `make verify` passes.","env_id":"492a5c71-6cda-48a6-8134-02ff6a672739","file_impact":[{"path":"src/rebar/reconciler/alert_store.py","reason":"hold the append lock across patch_bug_filed"},{"path":"tests/unit/reconciler/test_alert_store_patch_lock.py","reason":"lost-update regression test"}],"file_impact_scope":"paths","keyring":[],"last_status_env_id":"492a5c71-6cda-48a6-8134-02ff6a672739","managed_refs":[],"no_file_impact_reason":"","parent_id":null,"parent_status_uuid":"b874cf47-d0f5-4fd6-b302-dee876707912","plan_review_phase":"execution","preconditions_summary":{"status":"pre-manifest"},"priority":3,"releases":[],"repos":[],"reverts":[],"status":"in_progress","tags":["reconciler"],"ticket_id":"1e11-96bb-87da-456b","ticket_type":"bug","title":"alert_store.patch_bug_filed rewrites the alert file without the append lock and can drop a concurrent append","verify_commands":[]},"source_event_uuids":["6aa88073-9838-4710-a3a4-203a97078342","de37658d-63e9-488b-a5c8-55328d53e4ab","8fefe63e-8e74-4d3f-b46b-349cda267b14","0452945d-e5a3-4e29-91c4-8ec0a07180ed","b874cf47-d0f5-4fd6-b302-dee876707912","db04012c-8741-4c0a-ba14-ac3fd1d16388"]},"env_id":"","event_type":"SNAPSHOT","timestamp":1795152267337170002,"uuid":"e6ab4994-5ec0-45bb-aa94-784140550283"}